WEBVTT

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.184
But I'm also what people
call sex-positive.

00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:33.643
That means that
I fully support people's right

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:38.059
to enjoy whatever kind of sex life
and sexuality they find fulfilling,

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:40.059
no matter what it involves,

00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:43.393
as long as it includes
the enthusiastic consent

00:03:43.417 --> 00:03:45.059
of all parties involved.

00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:50.559
That said, I personally wasn't inclined
towards watching pornography.

00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:53.351
I'd seen some, didn't really
do anything for me.

00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:56.393
And as a mom of two
soon-to-be teenage children,

00:03:56.417 --> 00:03:58.184
I had my own concerns

00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:01.375
about what seeing pornography
could do to them.